.nh
.TH "glab" "1" "Sep 2026" "Auto generated by spf13/cobra" ""

.SH "نام (NAME)"
glab-stack-last \- Moves to the last diff in the stack. (EXPERIMENTAL)


.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBglab stack last [flags]\fP


.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Moves to the last diff in the stack, and checks out that branch.

.PP
This feature is an experiment and is not ready for production use.
It might be unstable or removed at any time.
For more information, see
https://docs.gitlab.com/policy/development_stages_support/.


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	Show help for this command.

.PP
\fB-R\fP, \fB--repo\fP=""
	Select another repository. You can use either OWNER/REPO or GROUP/NAMESPACE/REPO. The full URL or Git URL is also accepted.


.SH "مثال (EXAMPLE)"
.EX
glab stack last
.EE


.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\fBglab-stack(1)\fP
